Take this.

1253
00:59:09,539 --> 00:59:12,041
Take this. Put it back.

1254
00:59:22,151 --> 00:59:24,587
If anything happens,
you take this,

1255
00:59:24,687 --> 00:59:26,656
and you stab him
in the neck as hard

1256
00:59:26,756 --> 00:59:27,890
and as fast as you can.

1257
00:59:27,990 --> 00:59:29,192
-No! No, no!
-It has to be you.

1258
00:59:29,292 --> 00:59:30,460
He's watching me too closely.

1259
00:59:30,560 --> 00:59:32,830
-He won't expect us to do it.
-Sister, no!

1260
00:59:32,929 --> 00:59:34,330
Okay. Let's have a code word.

1261
00:59:34,430 --> 00:59:35,665
Okay? Um...

1262
00:59:35,765 --> 00:59:37,633
Hey, if I say
"magic underwear,"

1263
00:59:37,734 --> 00:59:39,569
that means stab. Okay?

1264
00:59:40,336 --> 00:59:41,337
(DISTANT THUD)

1265
00:59:41,437 --> 00:59:43,172
He's coming.

1266
00:59:43,272 --> 00:59:45,875
Magic underwear.
That's the code word. Okay?

1267
00:59:45,975 --> 00:59:47,143
(BREATHING HEAVILY)

1268
00:59:49,679 --> 00:59:51,347
(CREAKING)

1269
00:59:52,348 --> 00:59:53,616
(PAXTON WHIMPERS)

1270
00:59:54,550 --> 00:59:56,285
(DOOR UNLOCKS)

1271
01:00:01,891 --> 01:00:02,860
(DOOR OPENS)

1272
01:00:02,959 --> 01:00:05,161
(CREAKING)

1273
01:00:07,196 --> 01:00:09,599
(CREAKING CONTINUES)

1274
01:00:15,538 --> 01:00:17,774
-(OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING)
-(BOTH BREATHING HEAVILY)

1275
01:00:17,875 --> 01:00:19,075
Mr. Reed?

1276
01:00:19,942 --> 01:00:22,178
(OMINOUS MUSIC
CONTINUES PLAYING)

1277
01:00:24,547 --> 01:00:26,949
(SQUELCHY FOOTSTEPS)

1278
01:00:29,085 --> 01:00:31,154
(LANTERN CREAKING)

1279
01:00:34,090 --> 01:00:36,225
-(WHIMPERS)
-Mrs. Reed?

1280
01:00:37,895 --> 01:00:39,195
Is that you?

1281
01:00:43,766 --> 01:00:45,535
(OMINOUS MUSIC
CONTINUES PLAYING)

1282
01:00:53,976 --> 01:00:56,179
(PAXTON WHIMPERING)

1283
01:00:58,147 --> 01:00:59,382
(BARNES INHALES SHARPLY)

1284
01:00:59,482 --> 01:01:00,483
(PAXTON GASPS)

1285
01:01:02,685 --> 01:01:04,654
(BONES CRACKING)

1286
01:01:11,961 --> 01:01:13,629
What's happening to her?

1287
01:01:14,497 --> 01:01:16,132
(RATTLE)

1288
01:01:16,232 --> 01:01:18,401
<i>(CREEP</i> BY RADIOHEAD PLAYING)

1289
01:01:24,842 --> 01:01:25,775
(MR. REED MOCKINGLY SINGING)

1290
01:01:25,876 --> 01:01:27,076
<i>♪ But I'm a creep ♪</i>

1291
01:01:27,743 --> 01:01:29,913
<i>♪ I'm a weirdo ♪</i>

1292
01:01:30,012 --> 01:01:31,113
(MR. REED LAUGHING)

1293
01:01:31,214 --> 01:01:32,648
BARNES: Mr. Reed?

1294
01:01:35,853 --> 01:01:37,086
BARNES: Where are you?

1295
01:01:37,186 --> 01:01:39,355
-(BARNES BREATHING HEAVILY)
-(MR. REED HUMS ALONG)

1296
01:01:42,458 --> 01:01:44,594
<i>♪ Couldn't look you</i>
<i>in the eye ♪</i>

1297
01:01:48,064 --> 01:01:50,433
<i>♪ You're just like an angel ♪</i>

1298
01:01:53,069 --> 01:01:54,103
(FIRE CRACKLING)

1299
01:01:54,203 --> 01:01:56,772
<i>♪ Your skin makes me cry ♪</i>

1300
01:01:57,673 --> 01:02:00,009
(SCRAPING)

1301
01:02:03,012 --> 01:02:04,982
(GROANING, WHEEZING)

1302
01:02:11,955 --> 01:02:13,222
(SHUSHES)

1303
01:02:13,322 --> 01:02:14,958
(MOUTHING IMPERCEPTIBLY)

1304
01:02:15,057 --> 01:02:17,193
(WHIMPERING SOFTLY)

1305
01:02:18,761 --> 01:02:20,196
(MOUTHING) No.

1306
01:02:21,430 --> 01:02:23,099
(OBJECTS CLANKING IN DISTANCE)

1307
01:02:23,199 --> 01:02:25,568
<i>♪ And I'm a creep ♪</i>

1308
01:02:27,905 --> 01:02:29,372
(TENSE MUSIC PLAYING)

1309
01:02:29,472 --> 01:02:31,774
(WOMAN WHISPERING
INDISTINCTLY)

1310
01:02:38,015 --> 01:02:40,182
(PANTING)

1311
01:02:46,455 --> 01:02:49,325
-(MR. REED HUMMING)
<i>-(CREEP</i> CONTINUES PLAYING)

1312
01:02:50,526 --> 01:02:52,094
(PANTING)

1313
01:02:52,194 --> 01:02:53,162
(RATTLING)

1314
01:02:53,262 --> 01:02:54,764
<i>♪ I wanna have control ♪</i>

1315
01:02:58,200 --> 01:03:00,069
<i>♪ I want a perfect body ♪</i>

1316
01:03:00,169 --> 01:03:02,505
(SCRAPING)

1317
01:03:03,406 --> 01:03:05,107
(SCRAPING,
THUDDING BEHIND DOOR)

1318
01:03:05,207 --> 01:03:08,210
<i>♪ I want a perfect soul ♪</i>

1319
01:03:09,813 --> 01:03:12,515
<i>♪ I want you to notice ♪</i>

1320
01:03:15,384 --> 01:03:17,119
<i>♪ When I'm not around ♪</i>

1321
01:03:17,219 --> 01:03:19,589
(LOUD BANGING)

1322
01:03:20,891 --> 01:03:23,860
♪ <i>You're so very special ♪</i>

1323
01:03:26,997 --> 01:03:29,198
♪ <i>But I'm a creep ♪</i>

1324
01:03:32,970 --> 01:03:35,839
<i>♪ I'm a weirdo ♪</i>

1325
01:03:38,041 --> 01:03:41,377
<i>♪ What the hell</i>
<i>am I doin' here? ♪</i>

1326
01:03:44,213 --> 01:03:46,115
♪ <i>I don't belong here ♪</i>

1327
01:03:46,215 --> 01:03:47,783
-(TAPE PLAYER SCREECHES)
<i>-(CREEP</i> STOPS PLAYING)

1328
01:03:50,486 --> 01:03:51,955
MR. REED OVER SPEAKERS:
<i>I had to be sure</i>

1329
01:03:52,055 --> 01:03:53,589
<i>before I introduced you</i>
<i>to her.</i>

1330
01:03:54,624 --> 01:03:57,126
Sure about what?
(BREATH TREMBLING)

1331
01:03:57,226 --> 01:03:59,161
You are now in the presence

1332
01:04:00,063 --> 01:04:02,198
of a living prophet of God.

1333
01:04:02,298 --> 01:04:04,634
(WOMAN WHISPERING
INDISTINCTLY)

1334
01:04:10,272 --> 01:04:12,541
-(WOMAN WHEEZING)
-(BONES CRACKING)

1335
01:04:19,715 --> 01:04:21,118
MR. REED: <i>The reason</i>
<i>I invited you</i>

1336
01:04:21,217 --> 01:04:23,352
<i>into my sanctuary tonight</i>
<i>is because</i>

1337
01:04:23,452 --> 01:04:25,254
<i>I have been shown a miracle.</i>

1338
01:04:26,455 --> 01:04:27,824
<i>I believe</i>
<i>this miracle is proof</i>

1339
01:04:27,924 --> 01:04:30,760
<i>that all known religions</i>
<i>are demonstrably false,</i>

1340
01:04:30,861 --> 01:04:35,398
<i>and only an ancient echo</i>
<i>of something true.</i>

1341
01:04:37,134 --> 01:04:38,835
<i>I need a witness,</i>

1342
01:04:38,935 --> 01:04:43,372
<i>you, to verify</i>
<i>that the miracle is real.</i>

1343
01:04:45,207 --> 01:04:47,410
(OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING)

1344
01:04:57,954 --> 01:05:00,857
<i>Now, our family recipe</i>
<i>for blueberry pie is,</i>

1345
01:05:00,957 --> 01:05:02,458
<i>I think, a traditional one.</i>

1346
01:05:02,558 --> 01:05:05,695
The ingredients include
butter, flour, corn starch,

1347
01:05:05,796 --> 01:05:07,130
sugar, lemon,

1348
01:05:07,229 --> 01:05:09,099
blueberries, of course,

1349
01:05:09,198 --> 01:05:12,069
but tonight I've also included
some wolf's bane

1350
01:05:12,169 --> 01:05:13,502
and some belladonna,

1351
01:05:14,537 --> 01:05:17,740
which means that,
in a short while,

1352
01:05:19,575 --> 01:05:23,080
the Prophet will be dead
from consuming the pie.

1353
01:05:23,180 --> 01:05:25,347
(SQUELCHING)

1354
01:05:26,415 --> 01:05:27,450
MR. REED OVER SPEAKERS:
<i>Then,</i>

1355
01:05:27,550 --> 01:05:30,519
<i>you will witness a miracle.</i>

1356
01:05:32,189 --> 01:05:34,356
By the grace of God,

1357
01:05:35,826 --> 01:05:37,226
she will be resurrected.

1358
01:05:37,727 --> 01:05:39,930
(WHEEZING WEAKLY)

1359
01:05:45,601 --> 01:05:47,938
(CONTINUES WHEEZING WEAKLY)

1360
01:06:08,324 --> 01:06:10,292
-(RETCHES)
-(LANTERN CLATTERS)

1361
01:06:15,464 --> 01:06:16,933
Now, feel her pulse, please.

1362
01:06:18,367 --> 01:06:19,535
Both of you.

1363
01:06:20,871 --> 01:06:22,505
(WATER DRIPPING)

1364
01:06:22,605 --> 01:06:23,907
MR. REED OVER SPEAKERS:
<i>I need you</i>

1365
01:06:24,007 --> 01:06:26,408
<i>to feel her pulse right now!</i>

1366
01:06:30,412 --> 01:06:31,815
(PAXTON BREATHING HEAVILY)

1367
01:06:31,915 --> 01:06:33,482
MR. REED OVER SPEAKERS:
<i>Acknowledge, please,</i>

1368
01:06:33,582 --> 01:06:35,618
<i>that her heart has now</i>
<i>stopped pumping.</i>

1369
01:06:35,718 --> 01:06:37,954
<i>Do you know how to do that?</i>

1370
01:06:38,054 --> 01:06:39,755
<i>Index and middle finger</i>
<i>on the side of the neck,</i>

1371
01:06:39,856 --> 01:06:42,893
<i>in the soft, hollow area</i>
<i>just beside the windpipe.</i>

1372
01:06:44,527 --> 01:06:45,896
(BREATHING HEAVILY)

1373
01:06:45,996 --> 01:06:48,631
MR. REED: <i>Both of you, please,</i>
<i>lift her head to be sure.</i>

1374
01:06:51,868 --> 01:06:53,536
(SQUELCHING)

1375
01:06:56,006 --> 01:06:58,307
(PAXTON SHUDDERS)

1376
01:07:00,143 --> 01:07:01,111
-(PROPHET GURGLES)
-(PAXTON GASPS)

1377
01:07:01,211 --> 01:07:02,511
PAXTON: She moved! She moved!

1378
01:07:02,611 --> 01:07:05,081
MR. REED: (LAUGHING) <i>That was</i>
<i>just a catalytic spasm.</i>

1379
01:07:05,182 --> 01:07:06,515
PAXTON: (GASPS) She's alive!

1380
01:07:06,615 --> 01:07:08,185
MR. REED: <i>No! No, no. Not yet.</i>

1381
01:07:08,285 --> 01:07:09,853
<i>Chemicals being released</i>
<i>into her body.</i>

1382
01:07:09,953 --> 01:07:11,822
<i>Acknowledge, please,</i>
<i>that there's no pulse.</i>

1383
01:07:11,922 --> 01:07:12,956
(GRUNTS SOFTLY)

1384
01:07:13,056 --> 01:07:14,057
<i>Acknowledge!</i>

1385
01:07:14,157 --> 01:07:15,192
-No. No pulse.
-No pulse.

1386
01:07:15,292 --> 01:07:16,425
MR. REED: <i>Thank you.</i>

1387
01:07:16,525 --> 01:07:18,795
<i>Acknowledge that she is</i>
<i>no longer breathing.</i>

1388
01:07:21,330 --> 01:07:22,498
<i>Do you feel a breath?</i>

1389
01:07:27,270 --> 01:07:28,404
BARNES: No. No.

1390
01:07:28,504 --> 01:07:29,538
MR. REED: <i>So she's dead.</i>
BARNES: Yes.

1391
01:07:29,638 --> 01:07:31,407
-(WHIMPERS)
-MR. REED: <i>Okay.</i>

1392
01:07:32,008 --> 01:07:33,542
<i>Thank you.</i>

1393
01:07:33,642 --> 01:07:38,815
<i>A moment longer, and you will</i>
<i>witness a resurrection.</i>

1394
01:07:39,983 --> 01:07:42,551
<i>She'll return</i>
<i>and she will tell us</i>

1395
01:07:42,651 --> 01:07:44,486
<i>what she saw in the afterlife.</i>

1396
01:07:47,224 --> 01:07:48,524
Has the Prophet moved?

1397
01:07:49,226 --> 01:07:50,759
(TENSE MUSIC PLAYING)

1398
01:07:50,861 --> 01:07:52,361
No.

1399
01:07:52,461 --> 01:07:53,429
MR. REED OVER SPEAKERS:
<i>Hello?</i>

1400
01:07:53,529 --> 01:07:55,131
-No. No.
-Mmm-mmm.

1401
01:07:55,232 --> 01:07:56,333
(BARNES WHIMPERS)

1402
01:07:56,432 --> 01:07:59,035
MR. REED: <i>All right.</i>
<i>Just</i> un momentino.

1403
01:08:04,107 --> 01:08:05,507
<i>Only a moment longer.</i>

1404
01:08:07,077 --> 01:08:09,012
-(BELL RINGING)
-(GASPS)

1405
01:08:10,881 --> 01:08:12,481
(BREATHING RAPIDLY)
The Elders?

1406
01:08:14,918 --> 01:08:16,953
(DOORBELL RINGS)

1407
01:08:19,388 --> 01:08:21,258
(FOOTSTEPS ECHOING)

1408
01:08:21,358 --> 01:08:23,592
(DOOR LOCKS)

1409
01:08:27,730 --> 01:08:29,900
-(TENSE MUSIC PLAYING)
-(BOTH PANTING)

1410
01:08:32,401 --> 01:08:34,436
(PANTING)

1411
01:08:34,536 --> 01:08:36,538
-We scream.
-We scream.

1412
01:08:36,639 --> 01:08:39,009
BARNES: But not until
he answers the door.

1413
01:08:44,881 --> 01:08:46,649
(KNOCKING)

1414
01:08:47,516 --> 01:08:49,052
PAXTON: He's coming back.
BARNES: Scream! Scream!

1415
01:08:49,152 --> 01:08:51,054
(PAXTON AND BARNES SCREAMING)

1416
01:08:51,154 --> 01:08:51,955
(DOOR CREAKING)

1417
01:08:52,055 --> 01:08:54,490
-(DOOR SHUTS)
-(BOTH CONTINUE SCREAMING)

1418
01:08:55,091 --> 01:08:56,126
(LIGHTS CLICK)

1419
